>
> Do we need to adopt fsverity like we did in f2fs_write_begin()?
>
>         if (!(pos & (PAGE_SIZE - 1)) && (pos + len) >= i_size_read(inode) &&
>             !f2fs_verity_in_progress(inode)) {
>                 folio_zero_segment(folio, len, folio_size(folio));
>                 return 0;
>         }
