   ib_dealloc_pd_user+0x174/0x210
   uverbs_free_pd+0x8d/0xc0
   ib_uverbs_dealloc_pd+0x18e/0x1d0

Validate the access flags before mutating any state so the callback either
applies every requested change or none.

